# Attendance Windows-native QA v2 — runtime / evidence artifacts. NEVER commit these.
#
# Owner security boundary: the runtime identity map (qa-identities.json) and the host evidence
# directory may hold synthetic-but-sensitive material (the operator-set synthetic password read
# from env, any session/refresh token the harness obtains, per-run minted UUIDs). None of it may
# enter Git. Keep all of it under this gitignored runtime dir (or entirely outside the repo).
.runtime/
evidence/
qa-identities.json
summary.json
*.evidence.json
